OL,3,GNEWSAJudge praises girl for reporting
OL,4,A'sickening' abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FA judge has praised a girl for finding
OL,7,Fthe strength to report the "sickening"
OL,8,Fsexual abuse she suffered.
OL,10,FIan Hunter, 33, molested his young
OL,11,Fvictim then made her go through the
OL,12,Fordeal of giving evidence at Newcastle
OL,13,FCrown Court where she told him he was a
OL,14,F"coward" and she would "never forget"
OL,15,Fwhat he had done..
OL,17,FAs he jailed Hunter for eight years,
OL,18,Fjudge Tim Gittins said the girl's
OL,19,Ftestimony was "painful and powerful"
OL,20,Fand he hoped she would soon recognise
OL,21,Fherself as a "survivor" rather than a
OL,22,Fvictim.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
