OL,3,GNEWSAJudge praises girl for reporting
OL,4,A'sickening' abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FHunter, from Ashington, had denied
OL,7,Fwrongdoing but was found guilty of
OL,8,Fsexual assaulting a child under the age
OL,9,Fof 13.
